  "prefLabel": "Liq 703.07 Refunds Prohibited",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 703.07 Refunds Prohibited. The fees paid by any licensee for a license, regardless of the license term, shall not be refundable except when a refund request is received by the commission prior to the effective date of the license.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/liq100-1100.html"
